    "sub_name": "華語數位教學",
    "sub_ename": "DIGITAL CHINESE TEACHING",
    "describe_ch": "數位學習和數位教學成為華語教學的未來趨勢，本課程培養華語老師熟悉華語數位教學的類型和特色，善用數位科技輔助教學，並且運用網路華語學習資源，幫助學生達到數位學習的效果。",
    "describe_eh": "E-Learning and digital teaching have become the trends in Chinese teaching. This course helps Chinese teachers become familiar with digital teaching methods and utilize technology to enhance learning. It also teaches how to use online resources to help foreign students learn Chinese effectively in the digital age.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
